   ],
   "duration": 13.901,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Two real, independent sources on this exact mechanism agree, in their own words.",
     "start": 0.15,
     "end": 5.618
    },
    {
     "text": "A finished retry replays the saved response; a genuinely concurrent one gets a real conflict instead.",
